# Spotter UI kit

Before adding or redesigning UI in `src/pages` / `src/components`, follow the living kit at
`/app/admin/ui` (`src/pages/UiKitPage.tsx`) and tokens in `src/styles/global.css` +
`src/styles/sheets.css`.

## Must follow

1. **One primary action per section.** Default `.btn` is 48px. Secondary block actions use
   `.btn-sm` (40px) and/or `.btn-soft` / `.btn-ghost`. Do not stack many full-size ghost blocks.
2. **Secondary screens:** wrap back + title in `.subpage-top` (14px gap). Do not combine
   `.back-link { margin-bottom: 14px }` with an extra page grid gap between the same elements.
3. **Section headings:** only `SectionTitle` / `.section-title` — no one-off `h2` font sizes for
   the same role.
4. **SectionTitle actions:** use `.section-action` for Link and `<button>` (“Кого я лайкнул”,
   “Добавить”, “Изменить”). Same Manrope muted look — no `.text-link` / font-weight 650 in the
   action slot. Non-click meta → `.muted` / `.dim`. Admin accent nav links may keep `.text-link`
   outside SectionTitle.
5. **Section entry links:** use `.entry-tools` + `.entry-link` for destinations outside bottom-nav.
   - **A · Product tools** (frequent): Home grid `.entry-tools--2` (workouts, activity).
   - **B · Account / support meta** (rare): Settings section “Поддержка” (feedback, admin) —
     single column. Never Profile footer orphans / `.profile-quiet-link`.
   - **C · Contextual help:** soft/ghost `btn-sm` next to the empty task (e.g. request gym).
   Do not use `btn-primary` for support.
6. **Feedback:** `MomentFX` only for check-in / check-out / rare celebration. Routine success
   (like, copy, share) → `SoftFlash`.
7. **Bottom sheets:** compose `.app-sheet`, `.app-sheet-backdrop`, `.app-sheet-panel`,
   `.app-sheet-grab` + `useSheetA11y`. Do not invent another backdrop/panel copy-paste.
8. **Empty states:** `.empty-copy` + `.empty-copy-title` + `.empty-copy-lead` + one primary CTA;
   extra CTA → `btn-sm`.
9. **List rows with multiple actions:** primary navigation on the left; secondary (copy/expand)
   as separate targets — see workout history pattern on UiKit page.
10. **Profile edit:** Settings via header gear; do not add a second full-width “Редактировать
    профиль” CTA wall. Extra account/support links live in Settings, not Profile.

## Sources of truth

- Live demo: `/app/admin/ui`
- Code: `src/pages/UiKitPage.tsx`, `src/components/SectionTitle.tsx`, `src/components/SoftFlash.tsx`
- CSS: `src/styles/global.css`, `src/styles/sheets.css`
- Entry IA canvas: `feedback-entry-ia` (where feedback/admin belong)
